{# goal: Render the codebase-to-corpus reference-model delta plan (additions, modifications, contractions, dual-purpose retentions) and D10 licensing decisions for operator approval before mutating zk-ref-open. Deterministic (no LLM call). #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    revision_label:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
    current_run_id:
      type: string
      non_blank: true
    additions: array
    modifications: array
    contractions: array
    dual_purpose_retentions: array
    proposed_release_in_scope:
      type: boolean
      required: false
    open_questions:
      type: array
      required: false
---
## zk-ref-open Delta Plan — {{ revision_label }}

- **Current sealed run:** `{{ current_run_id }}`
- **Counts:** {{ additions | length }} add | {{ modifications | length }} modify | {{ contractions | length }} contract | {{ dual_purpose_retentions | length }} dual-purpose retain
- **Release upload (`release_in_scope`):** {% if proposed_release_in_scope is defined %}`{{ proposed_release_in_scope }}` (confirm or override){% else %}_operator decision required (`true` / `false`)_{% endif %}

### Additions ({{ additions | length }})
{% if additions | length == 0 %}
_None._
{% else %}
| Source | Citing surface | Proposed D10 license | Acquisition route |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for item in additions %}| `{{ item.source | default("unknown") }}` | {{ item.citing_surface | default("unspecified") }} | `{{ item.proposed_license | default("unspecified") }}` | {{ item.acquisition_route | default("unspecified") }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

### Modifications ({{ modifications | length }})
{% if modifications | length == 0 %}
_None._
{% else %}
| Source | Reason | Old SHA-256 | New SHA-256 |
|---|---|---|---|
{% for item in modifications %}| `{{ item.source | default("unknown") }}` | {{ item.reason | default("") }} | `{{ item.old_sha256 | default("n/a") }}` | `{{ item.new_sha256 | default("n/a") }}` |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

### Contractions ({{ contractions | length }})
{% if contractions | length == 0 %}
_None._
{% else %}
| Source | Retirement reason |
|---|---|
{% for item in contractions %}| `{{ item.source | default("unknown") }}` | {{ item.reason | default("") }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

### Dual-Purpose Retentions ({{ dual_purpose_retentions | length }})
{% if dual_purpose_retentions | length == 0 %}
_None._
{% else %}
| Source | Retained consumer |
|---|---|
{% for item in dual_purpose_retentions %}| `{{ item.source | default("unknown") }}` | {{ item.retained_consumer | default("") }} |
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

{% if open_questions is defined and open_questions | length > 0 %}
### Open Rulings Required ({{ open_questions | length }})
{% for q in open_questions %}
- {{ q }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
